Changes applied to UltraAttn (https://github.com/oliverYoung2001/UltraAttn) @ b5aa10e for the evaluation:
- search_algo/dcp_adapter.py, dcp_in_ultraattn.py, dump_plan_structure.py (added): build UltraAttn's dependent graph,
  fusion search and ILP schedule for a given block problem + deployment (from baselines/ua/deploy.py) and dump the
  resulting execution plan (owner, schedule_table, gpu_kernels) as JSON; --batch builds many plans in one process
  with per-task timing; --fob 1 builds the backward plan.
- graph_transformation_engine.py: transform mode 'ua_greedy' (UltraAttn's greedy fusion with a time budget,
  UA_FUSION_BUDGET_S) and mode 'none'; fused kernels enumerated over global GPU ids of a flat schedule table.
- dcp_in_ultraattn.py / search_engine.py / bsa_utils.py: kernel cost lookup by FLOP-linear rate when a fused shape is
  not profiled (UA_FAITHFUL=1: the executor's measured profile, log-log interpolation); profile keys for every reduced
  Q/KV length ratio up to 8; GQA head counts (--kv-heads); live-work scaling of partial blocks (dependent_graph.py).
- workload_partition.py: balance cap relaxed until the ILP is feasible; backward MCV coefficients.
- initialize.py / task1_bsa.py / task2_bsa.py / exp_configs.py / intra_attn_gen.py: torchrun launch, GPU bound before
  NCCL init, collective group creation on all ranks, node size from the environment (UA_GPU_PER_NODE, UA_CPS,
  UA_NHS), fp16 (UA_DTYPE), block tables from a file (UA_PATTERNS=99, UA_BLOCK_TABLE), simulated profiling
  (UA_SIM_PROFILE), fusion disabled (UA_NO_FUSION), per-step planning time, cluster name 'local'.
- orchestrated_attn/: flash-attn 2.7+ call signature; LSE-weighted merge of partial outputs in reduce();
  optional per-kernel CUDA-event trace (UA_TRACE).
- tests/distributed/device_communicators/pynccl*.py: integer peer ids for ctypes; tools/profile_kernel.py (added):
  the flash-attn timing table the cost model reads.

